<title>FINLAND: RALLYING-LEADING POSITIONS IN 1,000 LAKES RALLY.</title>
<headline>RALLYING-LEADING POSITIONS IN 1,000 LAKES RALLY.</headline>
<dateline>JYVASKYLA, Finland 1996-08-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading positions</p>
<p>after six of Sunday's 12 special stages in the 1,000 Lakes</p>
<p>Rally, sixth round of the world championship:</p>
<p> 1. Juha Kankkunen (Finland) Toyota Celica  2 hours 30 minutes</p>
<p>     52 seconds</p>
<p> 3. Tommi Makinen (Finland) Mitsubishi Lancer     8 seconds</p>
<p>     behind</p>
<p> 2. Marcus Gronholm (Finland) Toyota Celica    1:46</p>
<p> 4. Jarmo Kytolehto (Finland) Ford Escort	1:56</p>
<p> 5. Kenneth Eriksson (Sweden) Subaru Impreza   2:05</p>
<p> 6. Thomas Radstrom (Sweden) Toyota Celica     2:23</p>
